      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The rare cause of sciatic neuralgia, an abscess in the sciatic foramen, is presented. The most common causes of sciatic neuralgia are discussed. We analyse correlations between symptoms found in a young woman and anatomical structures of the supra- and infrapiriforme foramen and their neighborhood."},
